  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "コバルオンがたの　さいしん　へいきと　オカルトざっしが　しょうかいしたなぞの　ぶったいに　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "코바르온 형태의 최신 병기라며 오컬트 잡지에 소개됐던 정체불명의 물체를 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與超自然雜誌裡介紹是勾帕路翁型最新兵器的神秘物體長得很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à une entité mystérieuse qui, selon une revue sur les phénomènes paranormaux, serait une arme de pointe à l’effigie de Cobaltium.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt einem rätselhaften Objekt, das einer esoterischen Zeitschrift nach eine ultramoderne Waffe sein soll, die wie Kobalium aussieht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se asemeja a un extraño objeto descrito en una revista esotérica como \"un arma de tecnología punta con forma de Cobalion\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ricorda molto un misterioso oggetto descritto in una rivista di paranormale come un’arma di ultima generazione a forma di Cobalion.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It resembles a mysterious object introduced in a paranormal magazine as a cutting-edge weapon shaped like a Cobalion.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "コバルオン型の　最新　兵器と　オカルト雑誌が　紹介した謎の　物体に　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "与超自然杂志中介绍的名为勾帕路翁型最新兵器的神秘物体长得很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se asemeja a un extraño objeto descrito en una revista esotérica como \"un arma de tecnología punta con forma de Cobalion\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひかる　やいばを　うちだし　あたりのすべてを　きりさいたらしいがほかに　じょうほうはなく　しょうたいふめい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "빛나는 칼날을 발사하며 주위의 모든 것을 베어 버렸다고 하나 그 밖의 정보는 전무하여 정체불명이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "據說牠曾射出發光的刀刃劈開了周遭的一切，但沒有能得知其真面目的其他資訊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Outre le fait que ses lames lumineuses pourraient trancher tout ce qui l’entoure, il n’existe aucune autre information sur cette entité inconnue.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Angeblich hat es mit den leuchtenden Klingen, die es abfeuert, seine Umgebung komplett verwüstet, aber mehr ist nicht über es bekannt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que puede cortarlo todo a su alrededor lanzando afiladas hojas luminosas, pero nada más se sabe acerca de esta criatura.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice che possa tranciare tutto ciò che ha intorno sparando lame luminose. Questo è tutto ciò che si sa su questo Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "There was supposedly an incident in which it launched shining blades to cut everything around it to pieces. Little else is known about it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "光る　刃を　撃ちだし　あたりのすべてを　切り裂いたらしいがほかに　情報はなく　正体不明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "据说它曾经射出发光的刀刃砍断了周围的一切，但无其他信息，身份不明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que puede cortarlo todo a su alrededor lanzando afiladas hojas luminosas, pero nada más se sabe acerca de esta criatura.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
